  <p class="font-mono text-sm text-black/70 leading-relaxed">Dirty Rabbit in S'Agaró is the nearest option with Japanese-origin ceremonial matcha. Five minutes by road from Sant Feliu.</p>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-black/10 pb-5">
  <p class="font-typewriter font-bold mb-2">What makes the matcha at Dirty Rabbit different?</p>
